    "en": "Citation and commencement"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "1. These Regulations are the Geographical Indications (Composition of Offences) Regulations 2019 and come into operation on 21 November 2019."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "SG-H1613-A2",
